# T15-E-M26 [边界清单 #14] llmexcept 附着边界：llmexcept 语义上仅附着含行为表达式的语句，
#   对流式 await 语句附着 → 编译期 SEM_LLMEXCEPT_BINDING fail-fast（流式 provider 层失败
#   属非解析不确定域，不经 llmexcept retry——与 KERNEL_ISSUE-LLM-1 处置语义一致）
# doc: docs/syntax/10_robustness.md + docs/syntax/11_modules.md §11.3
# expect-class: GUARD
# expect-code: SEM_LLMEXCEPT_BINDING
# expect-exit: nonzero
# expect-llm: false
import ai
ai.set_mock_mode()
class 流错误:
    func __llm_call__(self) -> dict:
        return {"user_prompt": "MOCK:STREAM:a|b|MOCK:ERROR:500"}
try:
    str full = await ai.stream_call(流错误())
    llmexcept:
        retry "再试"
except Exception:
    print("no")
print("DONE")
